A table row ends a description body and a lone plus folds into a term

```
:: t
: a
| t |
.
<dl>
  <dt>t</dt>
  <dd>a</dd>
</dl>
<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td>t</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
```

```
:: term
+
: d
.
<dl>
  <dt>term</dt>
</dl>
<p>+
: d</p>
```

```
:: A term that
   wraps
+
: d
.
<dl>
  <dt>A term that</dt>
</dl>
<p>wraps
+
: d</p>
```
